t-bold text-amber-600\">$<!-- -->22,400</p></div></div><div class=\"mb-6\"><p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3 uppercase\">Inclusions</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-amber-600 mt-1\">✓</span>Luxury Safari Lodge</li><li class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-amber-600 mt-1\">✓</span>Expert Guides</li><li class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-amber-600 mt-1\">✓</span>Private Game Drives</li><li class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-amber-600 mt-1\">✓</span>Maasai Village Visits</li></ul></div><div class=\"mb-6 pb-6 border-b border-gray-200\"><p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3 uppercase\">Best For</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Wildlife photographers</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Nature lovers</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Adventure families</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Conservation enthusiasts</span></div></div><button class=\"w-full bg-amber-600 text-white py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-amber-700 transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">Inquire Now <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl border border-gray-200 overflow-hidden hover:shadow-lg transition\"><div class=\"relative h-64 w-full\"><img alt=\"Private Island Resort Escape\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\