 perfect for honeymoons and anniversaries.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-6 pb-6 border-b border-gray-200\"><div><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase font-semibold mb-1\">Duration</p><p class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900\">5-7 days</p></div><div><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase font-semibold mb-1\">Capacity</p><p class=\"text-lg font-bold text-gray-900\">2-4 guests</p></div><div><p class=\"text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase font-semibold mb-1\">Price</p><p class=\"text-lg font-bold text-amber-600\">$<!-- -->31,200</p></div></div><div class=\"mb-6\"><p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3 uppercase\">Inclusions</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-amber-600 mt-1\">✓</span>Private Overwater Villa</li><li class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-amber-600 mt-1\">✓</span>All-Inclusive Dining</li><li class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-amber-600 mt-1\">✓</span>Water Sports</li><li class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 flex items-start gap-2\"><span class=\"text-amber-600 mt-1\">✓</span>Private Spa</li></ul></div><div class=\"mb-6 pb-6 border-b border-gray-200\"><p class=\"text-sm font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3 uppercase\">Best For</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Honeymooners</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Romantic getaways</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Anniversaries</span><span class=\"text-xs bg-gray-100 text-gray-700 px-3 py-1 rounded-full\">Exclusive couples</span></div></div><button class=\"w-full bg-amber-600 text-white py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-amber-700 transition flex items-center justify-center gap-2\">Inquire Now <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 px-6 bg-amber-600 text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-serif font-bold mb-4\">Customize Your Perfect Experience</h2><p class=\"text-lg mb-8 opacity-90\">Can&#x27;t find exactly what you&#x27;re looking for? Our experts can create a bespoke experience tailored to your vision.</p><a class=\"inline-block bg-white text-amber-600 px-10 py-4 rounded-lg font-bold text-lg hover:bg-gray-100 transition\" href=\"/contact\">Create Custom Experience</a></div></section><footer class=\"bg-gray-900 text-white py-16 px-6\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-4 gap-12 mb-12\"><div><h3 class=\"font-serif font-bold text-amber-500 text-lg mb-4\">GARYPARROTBEACH</h3><p class=\"text-gray-400 text-sm leading-relaxed\">Luxury travel experiences for discerning travelers.</p></div><div><h4 class=\"font-semibold mb-4 text-white\">Discover</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-400 text-sm\"><li><a class=\"hover:text-amber-500 transition\" href=\"/destinations\">Destinations</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-amber-500 transition\" href=\"/experiences\">Experiences</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-amber-500 transition\" href=\"/about\">About Us</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"font-semibold mb-4 text-white\">Services</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-400 text-sm\"><li><a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-amber-500 transition\">Luxury Tours</a></li><li><a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-amber-500 transition\">Private Jets</a></li><li><a href=\"#\" class=\"hover:text-amber-500 transition\">Yacht Charters</a></li></ul></div><div><h4 class=\"font-semibold mb-4 text-white\">Contact</h4><p class=\"text-amber-500 font-semibold mb-2\">+1